# Default reviewers for the entire tree until WGs are formed (see ARCH-GOV-01).
# Per ADR-022 every PR needs two Maintainer reviews; CODEOWNERS encodes the
# routing layer for that gate. This file is intentionally coarse during M0 and
# will be sharded once internal/, pkg/ and adr/ have dedicated owners.

*                       @teragrid/maintainers

# ADRs and architecture artefacts require both Maintainer + Architect review.
/adr/                   @teragrid/maintainers @teragrid/architects
/ARCHITECTURE.md        @teragrid/maintainers @teragrid/architects
/THREAT_MODEL.md        @teragrid/maintainers @teragrid/security

# CI / supply-chain — DevSecOps owns these gates.
/.github/               @teragrid/maintainers @teragrid/devsecops
/Makefile               @teragrid/maintainers @teragrid/devsecops
/.golangci.yml          @teragrid/maintainers @teragrid/devsecops
